    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Some system user interfaces, like the macOS Video Effects Menu, display a video zoom factor value in a way most appropriate for visual presentation, which might differ from the [`videoZoomFactor`](avcapturedevice/videozoomfactor.md) property value.",
      "ko": "macOS Video Effects Menu와 같은 일부 시스템 사용자 인터페이스는 시각적 표현에 가장 적합한 방식으로 비디오 줌 팩터 값을 표시하며, 이는 [`videoZoomFactor`](avcapturedevice/videozoomfactor.md) 속성 값과 다를 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9e6812cafa9d1580c8b9c6de2a1a9974e2aac5a38d512308eb9e562d46c19aa4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Your app can key-value observe this property to update the display video zoom factor values in its user interface to stay consistent with Apple’s system UIs.",
      "ko": "To set the ISO, call the [`setExposureModeCustom(duration:iso:completionHandler:)`](avcapturedevice/setexposuremodecustom(duration:iso:completionhandler:).md) method.",
      "sourceHash": "2072a29c3b545e534c60a97bf244984be6f6aa9891d5c977d5b16d68cf190a4e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
